  "resolution_html": "<p>By default cc'd email addresses are not visible. To make them visible you can send the following email to <a href=\"mailto:listserv@yorku.ca\">listserv@yorku.ca</a> to be able to view the cc'd email addresses going forward:</p>\n<p>set [listname] IETFHDR</p>\n<p>There should be nothing else in the subject or body of the email</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/wp-content/plugins/yu-blockpatterns/img/learnmore.png\"/></figure>",
